<div class="ip-page-body">

<!-- ══ INTRO ══ -->
<section class="bd-intro">
  <div class="bd-intro__inner">
    <div class="bd-intro__image-col">
      <div class="bd-intro__image-wrap">
        <img src="/images/bird-divert-window-film-philadelphia-intro.jpg"
          alt="Window Film Philadelphia installer applying Bird Divert UV-reflective dot film to Philadelphia office glass"
          title="Bird Divert window film installation Philadelphia — authorized installer"
          width="600" height="720" loading="lazy" class="bd-intro__img" />
        <div class="bd-intro__badge">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l2.09 6.26H21l-5.47 3.97 2.09 6.27L12 14.54l-5.62 3.96 2.09-6.27L3 8.26h6.91L12 2z" fill="#81AB4C"/></svg>
          <span>ABC-Certified Installer</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bd-intro__content">
      <span class="bd-intro__eyebrow">Why Bird Divert &amp; Window Film Philadelphia</span>
      <h2 class="bd-intro__title">How does Bird Divert stop bird strikes?</h2>
      <p class="bd-intro__lead">Bird Divert is a durable UV dot matrix system — optically clear to the human eye — designed to prevent birds from colliding with windows and glass surfaces. The system applies two sizes of UV-absorbing and UV-reflective dots directly to glass at a precisely engineered spacing. Humans see nothing. Birds see a matrix of UV signals that reads as a physical obstruction and triggers avoidance. That's the whole system — no tint, no visible pattern, no change to how the glass looks from inside or outside your Philadelphia building.</p>
      <p class="bd-intro__body">Window Film Philadelphia is an authorized installer of Bird Divert window film in Philadelphia. The system uses 20-nanometer hollow glass spheres that reflect UV wavelengths up to 420 nm — the part of the light spectrum most birds see and humans do not. Applied in a precise dot pattern of 0.25" absorbing dots paired with 0.375" absorbing/reflective dots, Bird Divert is rated for 10-year durability and carries a 6-year warranty. Every installation is documented for ABC certification compliance and LEED credit submissions.</p>
      <div class="bd-intro__creds">
        <div class="bd-intro__cred">
          <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#81AB4C" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Authorized Bird Divert Installer
        </div>
        <div class="bd-intro__cred">
